/* The notices that wait for the player in the original look, the boxes of the player's award and item pickup states:
   the award notice (tamer.c: renderAwardSomethingTextbox) and the notice of an item on the ground or in a chest
   (tamer.c: renderItemPickupTextbox). Both are the story's speech box (../story_textbox/style.rcss) at its place,
   x 30 to 292 and y 162 to 221, with their text and the confirm button as the original draws them there.

   The text: renderString copies rows of the text area, 12 pixels each, to x -125 and y 45, 57 and 69 from the
   screen's centre, 5 pixels right of the box's left side and 3 below its top, where the speech box's first row starts
   too, but 12 pixels apart, not the speech box's 13. */

/* The box's fill is UI_BOX_COLORS 0, black, at half (createAnimatedUIBox color 0 with feature 2, a semi-transparent
   GsBOXF): the field shows through at half its light (capture of the sickness notice: 0.46 of it), darker than the
   speech box's. */
body #box {
	background-color: #00000080;
}

body .row {
	height: 36dp;
	line-height: 36dp;
}

/* The confirm button in the box's bottom right corner is the speech box's (../story_textbox/style.rcss). */
